Bundled third-party components
==============================

The `engine/` directory contains a curated subset of the AICheckin check-in
engine (bridge.py plus the per-platform adapters), which is also distributed
under the MIT License. Its original copyright notice is preserved in
`engine/ENGINE-LICENSE.txt`.

Its accompanying terms accompany the bundle and remain binding on use of the
bundled engine code:

  - `engine/DISCLAIMER.md` — the engine authors' own statement that these are
    personal local-automation scripts, not official tools of any platform, and
    that automated check-ins may trigger platform rate limiting, captchas, or
    account action.
  - `engine/SECURITY.md` — the engine authors' security policy.

By using this package you also accept those terms for the bundled engine
portion. Read both files before enabling `allowClaim`.
